cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this implementation, please cite both the original GeoFM paper and this repository."
title: "open-geofm: An educational reproduction of GeoFM on a single RTX 5090"
abstract: >-
  Single-GPU, LoRA-only educational reproduction of the data-generation
  methodology of GeoFM (Zhang et al., 2025, arXiv:2510.27448), targeting
  Qwen2-VL-2B/7B and Qwen2.5-VL-7B on an RTX 5090 (sm_120).
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-05-28
authors:
  - name: "open-geofm contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CallMeDaniel/open-geofm"
url: "https://github.com/CallMeDaniel/open-geofm"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - geometry
  - multimodal-llm
  - qwen2-vl
  - formal-language
  - educational-reproduction
references:
